<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JP Morgan starts Mycogen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JP Morgan starts Mycogen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said analyst Gilbert Yang initiated coverage of Mycogen Corp with a market performer rating and a 12-month price target of $17.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 14-1/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
